@startuml outbox-states
!include _style.iuml
title Notification outbox entry: delivery states (outbox.ts)
[*] --> pending : alert occurrence enqueued
[*] --> suppressed : enqueued while the event\nis muted or snoozed
pending --> sent : delivery succeeds
pending --> failed : delivery fails
pending --> suppressed : event paused\nbefore delivery
failed --> pending : operator presses Retry
failed --> suppressed : Retry while\nthe event is paused
sent --> [*]
suppressed --> [*]
note right of pending
  Every transition adds a DeliveryLog
  entry (time, status, detail).
  Superseded alerts are never enqueued.
  Delivery is a local simulation: no email,
  SMS or webhook leaves the browser.
end note
@enduml
